2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928160 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:107 *** and frame clocks requires multi-BTS infrastructure ***
2026/Jun/08 11:39:08.928165 USER TC_26_6_5_1.ttcn3:108 *** that is not available in the current test network. ***
